---
title: Dictionary
desc: A list of words in Bauhinian.
parent: Language
categories:
  - Lore
---
<style>
	dt {
		color: var(--text) !important;
	}
</style>
<p>Words listed: {{ dictionary.size }}</p>
<dl>
	{% for word in dictionary %}
		<dt id="{{ word.name }}">{{ word.bh }}<br><span class="smaller-text">{{ word.name }}</span></dt>
		<dd><em class="lighter-text">{{ word.pos }}</em><br>{{ word.def }}</dd>
	{% endfor %}
</dl>
